  "content": "Two rounds since September 1 had three or more three-putts. Both are Cole Bennett's tournament rounds at Springfield Country Club on October 21. Each had 3 three-putts and 37 putts, one in a 74 and one in a 77.\n\nTwo caveats on the 26 rounds I read since September 1:\n- **Qualifier rounds on September 25 and 26:** the 14 rounds from the six other players and Cole at the home course have no putts recorded. Their three-putt count shows 0, but with no putting data I'd treat that as not recorded rather than a clean sheet.\n- **Rounds that don't count:** three practice rounds for Cole are still in progress and have no stat line, so they can't qualify.\n\nCole's next highest counts were 2 three-putts in two practice rounds, on September 30 and October 6.",
